  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This has nothing to do with the recent update, it's something I've noticed for the past few days. Where sometimes,audio sources on avatars will break locally. So an audio source on my avatar will go mute, or, swap to an entirely unrelated audio source from someone else. So that when i activate it, I hear someone else's audio source instead of my own.\n\nI have also had this happen with other players audio sources. Where my audio source no longer worked, but one of their sources was swapped with an entirely different audio source. (in the case in question, it swapped for  one of my audio sources from a previous avatar I had out)\n\nMind you this is all local. On my end. So when i can't hear my audio source, or hear a different one for theirs, thats on my end only.\n\nAnd the only way to fix it is to restart the game\n\ni'll try and see about giving you some video the next time it happens, (for what that's worth, not sure how useful that is outside of \"yep, it's a bug\") but figured i'd put that out there since it is a bit annoying.",
